  "releaseNotes": "WorkflowForge.Extensions.Audit 2.2.0\n\nBREAKING\n- InMemoryAuditProvider(int maxEntries) throws ArgumentOutOfRangeException for values below one instead of silently substituting 10,000.\n\nFixed\n- AuditDetailLevel values are now distinct: Minimal omits metadata, duration and initiator; Verbose adds foundry properties; Complete adds input and output payloads. LogDataPayloads now captures payloads at any level above Minimal.\n- InMemoryAuditProvider evicts through a queue instead of List.RemoveAt(0), which was an O(n) memmove on every write once at cap.\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/animatlabs/workflow-forge/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#220---2026-09-15",
